  "name": "scikit-survival",
  "description": "Builds, evaluates, and audits right-censored survival analysis workflows with scikit-survival (sksurv): Cox PH, Coxnet, IPC ridge, survival trees, forests, boosting, and SVMs, plus nonparametric cumulative incidence for competing risks. Covers leakage-safe scikit-learn pipelines, nested CV, and censoring-aware metrics. Use when fitting survival models on time-to-event data, building structured outcome arrays, computing IPCW concordance, dynamic AUC, or Brier scores, estimating cause-specific cumulative incidence, or tuning models without leakage. Not for Fine-Gray regression, which scikit-survival does not provide.",
